{"version":1,"key":"card:771","content":{"id":771,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9e8482d7-b5b3-4c1f-b8de-6723177108c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"世界上有不少国家，人均收入早已脱离贫困线，生活水平也在改善，可就是卡在某个阶段上不去了，十几年甚至几十年都没有实质性突破。经济学上把这种现象称为中等收入陷阱。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b953f36-b86f-4b36-8fe6-1accd93b483b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"具体来说，当一个国家达到中等收入水平后，原有的增长动力逐渐耗尽，而新的增长动力尚未形成，经济发展陷入停滞，长期无法跻身高收入国家行列。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c47da5d5-6958-42c1-83ae-1fb3a255ad45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"落入这一陷阱通常是多重因素叠加的结果："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"aec46a1f-c640-41a5-b77f-280ec0eaa05e","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"53eeb3f2-ee4d-4d0a-9c3b-ea9f5b962001","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"380daee4-190e-4616-8c0b-95f6282a645f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"成本优势丧失，劳动力成本随收入水平上升，在低端制造业上无法再与更低成本的国家竞争"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f24e9a32-3b90-4835-912b-13743bb3f876","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"481abfb7-71e8-4470-ad1a-23b1a9d301f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"创新能力不足，在技术密集型和高附加值产业领域，又难以与发达国家抗衡"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0bceed03-f27e-471a-8d21-71ec2007307a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76a31588-d17f-4021-ad65-ec9c05c7ec4d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"结构性矛盾积累，产业升级缓慢、教育投入不足、贫富差距恶化，削弱了经济持续增长的内生动力"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b7e8cd2f-3c69-4b0a-9a4c-6acedbdb31b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跨越这一陷阱，本质上就是逐一破解上述问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"d5670c5f-2ac3-46db-8cac-acdc618154a5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3a9cf2e7-fe06-48a7-99de-f3aa12b0c668","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9a957be-d1ef-4001-8246-74a960320e0f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"加大教育和研发投入，培养高端人才，建立自主创新能力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c08e40ab-c5d8-4a57-89eb-aff85b1557da","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9c3a2428-53fd-4da8-8683-0be0a0a4f6c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"推动产业结构升级，从劳动密集型走向技术密集型，发展高附加值产业"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5e5ec552-03d8-4ad3-a669-8ae6b4bfab82","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4e78375f-2a78-4331-a0bf-f9741b0bcb28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"优化收入分配，扩大中等收入群体，建立完善的社会保障制度"}]}]}]}],"tags":["经济/中等收入陷阱"],"createTime":1782832411845,"updateTime":1782833376760,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1782833376760}}